Subject: [PATCH 3/4] driver portal: compute only the caller's year-to-date pay

MyYtdPay read every settlement in the organization (up to the 10,000-row
cap), summed every worker's pay, then kept the caller's row. The total
compensation statement in benefits did the same for one worker. Both grew
with the tenant, and past the cap a worker's own total came out short.

driversettlementservice gains GetWorkerYTDPaySummary, which asks the
repository for that worker's settlements alone and shares the folding with
GetYTDPaySummaries. MyYtdPay and the benefits statement use it.

